Session 4 summary — criteria NOT met (no marker written); the investigation advanced through seven build/run cycles and eliminated most of the suspect space:

**Root-cause progress (all RULE-4 instrumented, 7 runs on 7 builds v0.10.9→0.10.16):**
1. **Cold-iget mechanism REFUTED** — the sess3 discriminator (P14 `iget_age_ms`) showed 10–25s ages; the failing inodes were long-lived in-core.
2. **P15H strand-reap storm found and fixed** — 45 force-releases of live grants in 35s across 23 nodes (the 100ms strand threshold was calibrated for healthy clusters; the tenure floor makes ≤6s unconsumed grants legitimate). Threshold now 280 samples (~7s); reaps went to 0. Plus: CAW no-anchor unlocks made safe (P6ZC release-if-no-tenure), grant-meta bucket no-wipe hardening, table 4096→32768.
3. **The probe that was silent all of sess3/4 fixed** — `m_bsize` is in 512-byte sectors (=8), not bytes; every raw read EINVAL'd. With reads working, the "PLATTER-TORN" verdicts appeared — then were **proven decoder artifacts** (the scan misdecoded the dir's da3 interior node block as a leaf; its 2 child pointers looked like ghost refs).
4. **Writers and platter fully exonerated** — the new post-release audit (P70: raw FUA readback of dinode+bmbt+leaves right after every wire unlock, correct decoder) came back **refs_into_holes=0 on all 36 audits**. Laundering (P67: 1 benign fire) and cross-boundary stragglers (P63 extension: 0) also refuted.
5. **The remaining suspect is precisely cornered**: walkers under PR follow a leaf entry to a legally-freed data block with a fresh map — a stale *local cached leaf buffer*. The read-time dir-buffer invalidation (xfs_da_btree.c ~3776) trylock-skips dirty/locked buffers and then serves the stale image — the write side of that exact gap got the sess12 guard; the local-read side never did.

**Next session**: add the P72-READSKIP-STALE probe at the read-time invalidation skip arms, correlate with same-node P14s, then fix (read-around or bounded evict-retry); plus the queued grant-meta invalidate-at-unlock (kills the ghost-seq problem underlying the P15H false-orphan signature). Then cache_coherency@32 ×2 green → trio → dir_reuse → full 1/2/4/8/16/32 ladder. Handoff memories `AAA-ccloop46ef-sess4-PLATTER-TORN-PROVEN-laundering-hunt` and `AAA-ccloop46ef-sess4-END-writers-exonerated-readskip-next` carry the full evidence chain.

